From 7a81c40f8d147a6c913311b58bf9b3bc5738b1ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:58:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] test-posix: Check shmget, shmctl, shmat and shmdt

Creation and zero fill, every shmid_ds member through IPC_STAT and
IPC_SET, IPC_RMID with and without attachments, attaching at a given
or rounded address and read-only, detaching only at the start
address, and the errors.
---
